      <ActivityOrMissionDesc>OUR MISSION IS TO ADVANCE SCIENTIFIC KNOWLEDGE AND PROMOTE SUSTAINABLE PRACTICES FOR THE BENEFIT OF OUR OCEANS. AS A RESEARCH VESSEL, WE PROVIDE A PLATFORM FOR OCEANOGRAPHERS AND RESEARCHERS TO CONDUCT EXPERIMENTS, FOSTERING INNOVATION AND DISCOVERY IN MARINE SCIENCE. WE RUN TAG-AND- RELEASE MISSIONS TO HELP RESEARCHERS BETTER TRACK THE POPULATIONS OF MARLIN &amp; KEY PELAGIC SPECIES. ADVOCATING FOR RESPONSIBLE FISHING PRACTICES, SOURCING FISH THAT ARE CAUGHT SUSTAINABLY, AND PROMOTING ALTERNATIVES TO PLASTIC. THROUGH OUR WORK, WE AIM TO CREATE A MORE HARMONIOUS RELATIONSHIP BETWEEN HUMANITY AND THE OCEANS, PRESERVING THEIR HEALTH AND WELL-BEING FOR GENERATIONS TO COME.</ActivityOrMissionDesc>
